      "text": "លំហាត់គំរូ ១: រកព្រីមីទីវ F(x) នៃ f(x)=x² ដែល F(3)=2។",
      "normalizedText": "Find the antiderivative F(x) of f(x)=x² given the initial condition F(3)=2.",
      "problem": {
        "textKh": "រកព្រីមីទីវ F(x) នៃ f(x) = x² ដែល F(3) = 2",
        "text": "Find the antiderivative F(x) of f(x) = x² such that F(3) = 2",
        "latex": "f(x) = x^2, \\quad F(3) = 2"
      },
      "solutionSteps": [
        {
          "textKh": "ព្រីមីទីវនៃ f(x)=x² គឺ F(x) = 1/3·x³+c ព្រោះ F'(x)=x²",
          "text": "General antiderivative: F(x) = (1/3)x³ + c",
          "latex": "F(x) = \\frac{1}{3}x^3 + c"
        },
        {
          "textKh": "ដាក់ F(3)=2: 2 = 1/3·27+c → 2=9+c → c=−7",
          "text": "Apply condition F(3)=2: 2 = (1/3)(27)+c = 9+c, so c = −7",
          "latex": "F(3) = 2 \\Rightarrow \\frac{1}{3}(3^3) + c = 2 \\Rightarrow 9 + c = 2 \\Rightarrow c = -7"
        }
      ],
      "finalAnswer": {
        "textKh": "ដូច្នេះ F(x) = 1/3·x³−7",
        "text": "F(x) = (1/3)x³ − 7",
        "latex": "F(x) = \\frac{1}{3}x^3 - 7"
      },
